            {
                "comment": "Sarah is very smart and very kind, but she just doesn't grade at all. The semester is officially over, with my final exam turned it last week, and I still don't have a single grade in canvas. As a student, how am I supposed to know what I'm doing if she never grades anything? ",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 2
            },
            {
                "comment": "Sarah Lord is a great person and knows a lot about math but I feel like her lecturing led me askew quite a bit, and when we should've been doing interactive activities to really learn the concepts, we were either reading them in a textbook (which is hard for me to learn math/theories from reading about it) or being lectured in class for too long. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 2
            },
            {
                "comment": "Overall good lecturer. Sometimes she goes in too deep to the content, but it's just because she wants us to truly grasp it. Takes FOREVER to grade, though. I wished I had more feedback throughout the semester. Very mindful of student's lives, however. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 3
            },
